[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=23 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="海图铺在一个倒扣的木箱上，边角压着扳手。图上有两条铅笔线，一条划穿黑色的礁区，一条消失在昨夜留下的水渍里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="红线是原航道，现在走不了。西边这片没测完，拉姆森的舵又受了伤，急弯她跟不上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这里为什么画着两层岸线？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="下面是旧城，上面是露出水面的东西。海会涨，楼不会自己走。画一条线容易，信它才会死人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你伸手碰到纸边。没有完整的回忆回来，只有一些很细碎的感觉：铅笔在指腹上的阻力，手表秒针的声音，以及一句听不清是谁说的“后面的也算上”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果先从这边出去……不，等一下。补给艇会被留在转弯外面。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="你看得懂队形？"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我不知道。只是觉得，不能把线画得这么紧。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="很多人会觉得。我们现在需要的是哪边、什么时候转、谁先走。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="帕金斯没有把图收回去。她把扳手移开，给你腾出一块能落笔的地方。你看了看弗莱彻；她只问了一件事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="假如走错，你还会留在这里吗？"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我连能去哪儿都不知道。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="那就先和我们一起。你说航路，我盯着后面。"

tone="resolve"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="别被她吓着。她每次出航前都问，不过通常问的是发动机。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="右边的响声近了。先把路线看完，我们会稳住队形。报清楚往哪边走，比急着喊一句有用。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把第一段线画得很短，留出一个随时能回头的弯。德雷顿把木箱扶稳了。三个人都没有再问你的名字。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="先确认落在后面的那艘。我们得知道大家都能走多快。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森，回话。接下来跟我们的航路走，转不过来就喊，别自己硬扛。"

tone="resolve"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="收到了。我还没慢到要你们替我数浪。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="无线电里轻轻笑了一声。你握着那截铅笔，第一次觉得自己不是一件刚被捞上来的东西。前面有雾，后面有人在等你的下一句话。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "resolve"}

